<p>I was sitting in the dark of my backyard last night, admiring the planets, <em>as you do</em>, when I noticed a blob of <em>something</em> in the tree looking down at me. My distance vision is 20/20, yet I still could not make it out. I pulled out my iPhone and used the 5x lens in dark mode. It kept the shutter open for a few seconds and returned this image.</p>



